<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co, C.V. said on Wednesday it has launched 150 million American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>STRIKE PRICE	HK$176.50	 PREMIUM	     17.7 PCT</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.00	   GEARING	     15.9X</p>
<p>EXPIRATION	  20.NOV.97	 BOARD LOT	   4,000</p>
<p>LISTING	     HONG KONG	 SETTLEMENT DATE   3.DEC.96</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE    HK$158.50	 LISTING DATE	5.DEC.96</p>
<p>NOTES: PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY. GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
